The ZIP files in this directory are from:

  m4lwhere/Bloodhound-CE-Sample-Data - https://github.com/m4lwhere/Bloodhound-CE-Sample-Data
  Licensed under the Unlicense (public domain)

They are BloodHound.py CE exports from the GOAD lab (three domains:
NORTH, ESSOS, SEVENKINGDOMS) used as integration test fixtures for
validating PathCutter's ingest pipeline against real-world-like data.
